From: Yuya Hamamachi <yuya.hamamachi.sx@renesas.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:47:23 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: renesas: sparrow-hawk: Add IMX477 camera overlays

Add device tree overlays for the Raspberry Pi HQ Camera (IMX477) on the
camera connectors J1 and J2. The sensor is connected with 2 data lanes and
the link frequency is 450 MHz.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [no upstream]

